    "description": "A rich and silky cream containing our proprietary Quad Ginseng Complex delivers a powerful blend of antioxidants and leaves skin smooth, soft and plump with moisture. Baobab, squalane and hyaluronic acid cocoon the face with lasting hydration that absorbs quickly, quenching skin in a dreamy, creamy, dewy glow. For best results, use on damp skin and apply using our Glow Deeper 9 Point Facial massage technique. To maximize the hydrating benefits of the cream, use after exfoliating with the Rosé Resurfacing Facial Mask to seal in moisture and soothe the skin. Select Awards & Honors: Winner of the 2022 Popsugar Beauty Awards Best Moisturizer Winner of the 2022 Soko Glam Best of K-Beauty ® Rising Star Award for Best Texture 50 mL / 1.69 fl oz",
